step Zul'Mamwe
  tip Head north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. Ana'thek the Cruel guards the south-western ruins, and one pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all.
  goto 45.4,36.2 "Skullsplitter warriors"
  collect 1524 quest 209.1
  kill 669 quest 586.1                -- Skullsplitter Hunter walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  kill 781 quest 586.2
